    <li>circumstance_phrase->while looking into [ANIMAL_nameDef]'s eyes</li>
    <li>circumstance_phrase->with a sense of satisfaction</li>
    <li>desc_sentence->[ANIMAL_nameDef] is snuggling up against [HUMAN_nameDef].</li>
    <li>desc_sentence->[ANIMAL_nameDef] looks sleepy and drunk with love.</li>
    <li>desc_sentence->[ANIMAL_nameDef] stands tall and looks noble.</li>
    <li>desc_sentence->[ANIMAL_nameDef] is responding positively.</li>
  -->
  <BondedWithAnimal.rulePack.rulesStrings>
    <li>tale_noun-&gt;[ANIMAL_nameDef]ـﺑ [HUMAN_nameDef] ﻁﺎﺒﺗﺭﺍ</li>
    <li>image-&gt;[ANIMAL_nameFull] [circumstance_group]ـﺑ ﻂﺒﺗﺮﻳ [HUMAN_nameFull]</li>
    <li>image-&gt;[ANIMAL_nameFull] [circumstance_group] ﻊﻣ ﺎًﻘﻴﻤﻋ ﺎًﻄﺑﺍﺭ ﻞﻜﺸﻳ [HUMAN_nameFull]</li>
    <li>image-&gt;[ANIMAL_nameFull] [circumstance_group] ﺎًﻘﺣ ﺐﺤﻳ [HUMAN_possessive] ﻥﺃ ﻙﺭﺪﻳ [HUMAN_nameFull]</li>
